WEBVTT

01:30.360 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:50.920 --> 01:52.160
Zhao Ming…

01:57.200 --> 01:58.720
Xie Xuechen…

02:13.720 --> 02:15.480
Ten thousand years have passed…

02:17.920 --> 02:19.600
It has been ten thousand years…

02:27.560 --> 02:29.560
All the schemes I devised,

02:30.800 --> 02:32.520
all the blood on my hands,

02:35.000 --> 02:37.160
it was all a joke in the end,

02:37.240 --> 02:40.000
a meaningless joke!

02:42.960 --> 02:44.680
The one I sought to kill

02:46.360 --> 02:49.080
was the one I remembered for 10,000 years!

02:59.120 --> 03:00.600
Your single word

03:00.680 --> 03:03.160
can bring pain to all

03:03.240 --> 03:05.600
and can bury all sins!

03:07.680 --> 03:10.480
Why? Why?

03:25.000 --> 03:27.280
THE EXTREME FIRE AND THE GREAT WATER

03:42.080 --> 03:43.920
The Divine Clan is merciless,

03:44.840 --> 03:46.560
and I am sinful too.

03:47.280 --> 03:48.800
Let this 10,000 years of nonsense

03:48.880 --> 03:51.640
end today!

04:10.320 --> 04:12.200
Ignite my soul,

04:12.280 --> 04:13.600
sacrifice my life,

04:14.200 --> 04:15.320
activate the Eightfold Array…

04:16.600 --> 04:18.519
Break!

04:21.200 --> 04:23.120
That sacrificial altar stood so high.

04:23.760 --> 04:25.560
The Holy Lord stood so far away.

04:25.640 --> 04:27.800
I couldn't make out his face,

04:27.880 --> 04:29.680
but I'll always remember

04:30.400 --> 04:32.680
his resolve to slay the deities.

04:33.800 --> 04:35.760
The ways of the Divine Clan
are not righteous.

04:35.840 --> 04:39.000
Today, I want only the sun and moon
to remain in this world…

04:39.520 --> 04:41.160
No more deities.

04:41.240 --> 04:42.160
This is

04:42.760 --> 04:44.000
my lifelong wish.

04:45.120 --> 04:47.120
This is also…

04:49.240 --> 04:51.160
my lifelong wish.

05:02.080 --> 05:03.160
Xuanling,

05:05.160 --> 05:06.640
didn't you tell me

05:08.120 --> 05:09.480
you hate being bored?

05:10.880 --> 05:12.240
If you fall asleep,

05:13.440 --> 05:15.040
all that's left is silence.

05:18.960 --> 05:20.480
Please wake up.

05:23.000 --> 05:24.880
I still want to take you
to see the human world,

05:26.600 --> 05:28.520
to explore the vast world together.

05:29.640 --> 05:30.840
Whatever you wish to do,

05:32.080 --> 05:34.600
I will stay by your side. Alright?

05:48.360 --> 05:49.680
Xie Xuechen,

05:50.400 --> 05:52.280
you ended the war
between humans and spirits,

05:52.800 --> 05:54.480
froze the Void Sea,

05:57.280 --> 05:58.760
and rebuilt the Immortals Array.

05:59.280 --> 06:00.960
It looks like a great victory,

06:01.480 --> 06:03.240
but in truth, it was a crushing defeat.

06:03.760 --> 06:05.000
Xie Xuechen,

06:05.680 --> 06:07.040
admit it.

06:07.120 --> 06:09.160
Your arrogance killed her.

06:12.720 --> 06:14.120
I won't let her die.

06:15.200 --> 06:16.840
But she is already dead.

06:16.920 --> 06:18.040
I said,

06:18.560 --> 06:20.400
I won't let her die!

06:26.760 --> 06:27.840
Really?

06:28.360 --> 06:32.000
You once betrayed me,
suppressed me without hesitation,

06:32.720 --> 06:35.560
and now you're willing to die
for Xie Xuechen?

06:36.400 --> 06:37.560
Fine.

06:39.560 --> 06:41.320
This isn't over.

06:42.320 --> 06:44.160
We will meet again.

06:46.400 --> 06:48.760
-So, there was never a land free of worry.
-True.

06:48.840 --> 06:49.960
Master has been using us all along.

06:50.040 --> 06:52.440
For years, he gathered us
just for this moment!

06:52.520 --> 06:54.120
Why did Master deceive us?

06:54.920 --> 06:57.000
-Yeah! Why?
-Why?

06:57.080 --> 06:58.120
-Where is Master?
-Where is he?

06:58.200 --> 06:59.160
-Speak up!
-Tell us!

06:59.240 --> 07:00.240
-Tell us!
-Why?

07:00.320 --> 07:01.520
-Tell us!
-Why?

07:01.600 --> 07:03.240
-Tell us!
-Why? Say it!

07:05.760 --> 07:07.440
What we believed in

07:07.520 --> 07:11.120
sought to kill us by the Lava,

07:13.000 --> 07:14.680
and what we hated

07:18.760 --> 07:21.120
saved us in the face of doom.

07:21.200 --> 07:23.560
Right and wrong,

07:23.640 --> 07:24.800
good and evil,

07:24.880 --> 07:26.640
from the very beginning,

07:27.600 --> 07:28.760
it was all a lie.

07:28.840 --> 07:30.640
It was all a lie!

07:32.000 --> 07:33.120
Xie Xuechen!

07:39.640 --> 07:40.560
Miss Mu…

07:40.640 --> 07:42.120
-Thank you, Mr. Xie, for saving my life!
-Thank you!

07:42.200 --> 07:45.520
-Thank you for saving my life!
-Thank you!

07:45.600 --> 07:49.240
-Thank you, Mr. Xie, for saving my life!
-Thank you, Mr. Xie

08:03.120 --> 08:04.240
Thank you, Mr. Xie!

08:18.240 --> 08:19.160
Xuanling,

08:21.640 --> 08:23.000
rest here for a while.

08:24.400 --> 08:26.080
I need to take care of some matters.

08:26.800 --> 08:28.440
It will be a while before I return.

08:29.360 --> 08:30.840
I'll leave Jun Tian with you.

08:32.840 --> 08:34.440
It can sense me…

08:36.120 --> 08:37.440
and keep you safe.

08:56.800 --> 08:57.800
Xuanling…

09:16.440 --> 09:17.360
Xuanling…

09:19.480 --> 09:20.320
Wait for me.

09:20.400 --> 09:23.440
GREENVIEW HEIGHTS

09:24.280 --> 09:25.280
Master is still alive,

09:25.880 --> 09:27.080
but the spiritual power can't enter.

09:27.160 --> 09:28.000
Why is that?

09:28.080 --> 09:29.480
There's only one possibility.

09:30.200 --> 09:31.960
Master refuses
to accept her spiritual power.

09:32.040 --> 09:33.040
Master…

09:33.760 --> 09:34.680
is seeking death.

09:34.760 --> 09:35.840
Shut up!

09:35.920 --> 09:37.480
Bring me all the spiritual herbs now!

10:20.280 --> 10:23.000
Thank you for bringing me back
to Greenview Heights.

10:23.080 --> 10:24.160
I'm no longer a spirit slave.

10:24.840 --> 10:26.320
No one bullies me anymore.

10:26.920 --> 10:29.040
Hawthorn candy. I'm returning it to you.

10:32.400 --> 10:33.720
Why return it?

10:35.240 --> 10:36.720
And after that,

10:37.440 --> 10:38.560
what will you do?

10:45.360 --> 10:46.640
After I return this,

10:47.160 --> 10:49.440
I'll go find Xie Xuechen.

11:00.800 --> 11:02.880
This hawthorn candy is deceiving.

11:04.400 --> 11:06.400
Only the outer layer is sweet.

11:07.320 --> 11:08.760
Inside, it's terribly sour.

11:10.320 --> 11:11.880
Why do you like it?

11:19.600 --> 11:20.800
What I like…

11:22.720 --> 11:24.000
is not the candy.

11:25.040 --> 11:26.200
Then what is it?

11:27.440 --> 11:28.400
Is it me?

11:31.120 --> 11:32.400
Enough to make you

11:33.680 --> 11:35.640
want to kill Xie Xuechen?

11:39.160 --> 11:40.520
Why do you want to kill him?

11:41.440 --> 11:43.360
What did he do wrong?

11:45.240 --> 11:47.040
He did nothing wrong.

11:48.520 --> 11:49.680
The mistake lies with me,

11:51.240 --> 11:52.440
with fate.

11:52.520 --> 11:54.240
What fate?

11:54.800 --> 11:56.760
I once divined your fate.

11:57.920 --> 11:59.480
You and Xie Xuechen

12:00.160 --> 12:01.200
are destined to meet

12:02.480 --> 12:03.320
but not meant to be.

12:03.400 --> 12:05.120
Even so,

12:06.560 --> 12:08.360
why must you kill him?

12:11.920 --> 12:14.000
Before, I couldn't understand

12:15.160 --> 12:17.240
the true meaning of the divination.

12:19.320 --> 12:22.480
But when I learned
you were the Chaos Pearl,

12:23.640 --> 12:26.520
I finally grasped the real meaning.

12:27.800 --> 12:29.360
It foretells a life-or-death tragedy.

12:29.440 --> 12:32.680
Between you and him, if one lives,

12:32.760 --> 12:33.760
the other must die.

12:34.520 --> 12:36.240
Your tragedy is nearing.

12:37.080 --> 12:38.520
I wanted to save your life,

12:39.360 --> 12:40.760
but I didn't expect

12:41.560 --> 12:42.600
that I…

12:45.080 --> 12:47.640
would become a part of the tragedy.

13:08.200 --> 13:10.040
I promised to repay my life to you.

13:11.920 --> 13:13.280
Take it.

13:20.440 --> 13:21.560
Your kindness,

13:22.320 --> 13:23.880
I don't need it.

13:25.720 --> 13:26.800
Your life,

13:28.440 --> 13:29.560
I don't desire it.

13:43.360 --> 13:44.320
Don't go!

14:00.680 --> 14:02.480
In the Separation Array,

14:05.120 --> 14:06.640
a single breath decides life and death.

14:11.360 --> 14:13.440
If I said I'd repay my life to you,

14:15.800 --> 14:17.360
then it belongs to you.

14:30.560 --> 14:31.600
Nan Xuyue,

14:31.680 --> 14:32.960
there are still people
you haven't let go of,

14:33.040 --> 14:34.080
places you haven't found,

14:34.160 --> 14:35.280
and dreams you haven't uncovered.

14:35.880 --> 14:38.000
You can't die. Wake up!

14:54.200 --> 14:55.240
Nan Xuyue!

15:05.480 --> 15:07.480
I'll share a little of my affection

15:07.560 --> 15:08.800
with you.

15:10.040 --> 15:10.880
Alright?

15:19.320 --> 15:20.400
Nan Xuyue!

15:21.640 --> 15:23.240
Nan Xuyue!

15:44.840 --> 15:46.560
Call upon Fate!

15:47.440 --> 15:48.960
Who dares call upon me?

15:49.040 --> 15:50.440
We, the Divine Clan,

15:50.520 --> 15:52.360
call upon Fate!

15:52.440 --> 15:55.360
Humans have worshiped the Divine Clan
for generations,

15:55.440 --> 15:57.720
and we have safeguarded them.

15:57.800 --> 15:58.760
However,

15:58.840 --> 16:00.080
-now the Spirit Clan runs wild
-Stop!

16:00.160 --> 16:01.640
in the human realm,

16:01.720 --> 16:03.680
slaughtering humanity.

16:03.760 --> 16:04.840
Today, we call upon Fate

16:04.920 --> 16:06.800
to reform the evil spirits.

16:06.880 --> 16:10.280
Today, we call upon Fate
to reform the evil spirits,

16:10.360 --> 16:13.560
to bring an end to Spirit Clan atrocities
in the human world!

16:14.400 --> 16:15.240
Approved.

16:15.840 --> 16:16.880
The spirits of the mortal realm,

16:16.960 --> 16:18.800
unless they are weak,

16:18.880 --> 16:20.400
shall perform good deeds,

16:20.480 --> 16:21.800
living without conflict with humans.

16:21.880 --> 16:23.240
The Book of Fate,

16:23.320 --> 16:25.000
its words become law.

16:25.080 --> 16:26.440
It rewrites cause and effect,

16:26.520 --> 16:28.440
reordering the universe.

16:28.520 --> 16:30.200
We bow in gratitude!

16:30.280 --> 16:32.400
-Thank you, Fate!
-Thank you, Fate!

16:46.200 --> 16:48.920
Fate, you're back.

16:52.360 --> 16:54.400
You observe others' destinies every day.

16:54.480 --> 16:55.960
Don't you find it dull?

16:56.040 --> 16:58.160
You and I were born in chaos,

16:58.240 --> 16:59.760
sharing longevity with the universe,

16:59.840 --> 17:01.560
transcending all realms.

17:01.640 --> 17:03.120
Whether interesting or dull,

17:03.840 --> 17:04.680
what does it matter to me?

17:04.760 --> 17:06.640
A world of change

17:07.160 --> 17:08.440
is nothing but fleeting moments.

17:08.520 --> 17:09.440
Even the Divine Clan,

17:10.240 --> 17:11.480
generation after generation,

17:12.319 --> 17:14.079
are merely passing visitors
in the Celestial Palace.

17:14.599 --> 17:16.079
Only our companionship

17:16.720 --> 17:17.920
is eternal.

17:18.440 --> 17:19.280
Fate,

17:21.040 --> 17:22.920
you will never understand love.

17:23.000 --> 17:24.960
If you refuse to rewrite his destiny,

17:25.599 --> 17:26.839
then I shall

17:27.680 --> 17:29.400
write his fate myself!

17:39.520 --> 17:43.360
Even if the Book of Fate burns
and the Pearl loses its light,

17:44.280 --> 17:45.920
I will never yield.

17:52.600 --> 17:54.840
You say I don't understand love,

17:56.560 --> 17:58.040
then I shall descend to the mortal world

17:59.080 --> 18:00.280
to see for myself

18:01.720 --> 18:03.280
what the love you mentioned

18:04.160 --> 18:05.760
truly is.

18:06.680 --> 18:07.760
When that time comes,

18:09.400 --> 18:11.160
you will return,

18:11.240 --> 18:12.600
won't you?

19:00.480 --> 19:03.120
Sir, what was that just now?

19:03.200 --> 19:04.520
I thought you were going to die.

19:05.600 --> 19:07.680
Nan Xuyue despises the world and himself.

19:08.840 --> 19:10.640
Do you think you can save him?

19:11.520 --> 19:14.040
You… Who are you?

19:15.960 --> 19:16.840
I am…

19:22.960 --> 19:24.040
Fate.

19:30.160 --> 19:32.280
XIE XUECHEN, JIANG LI

19:58.800 --> 19:59.920
The agreement is signed,
and the war is over.

20:01.080 --> 20:02.480
From now on,
humans and spirits shall cease fighting

20:03.000 --> 20:04.000
and restore peace.

20:04.080 --> 20:05.040
All of you,

20:06.120 --> 20:07.920
thanks to Mr. Xie's forgiveness,

20:08.000 --> 20:09.680
we've been saved from disaster.

20:09.760 --> 20:11.160
I, Jiang Li,

20:11.240 --> 20:12.720
swear on behalf of the Spirit Clan

20:15.160 --> 20:16.760
that from this day forward,

20:16.840 --> 20:19.320
all spirits will create no further unrest.

20:19.400 --> 20:20.680
If this vow is broken,

20:23.320 --> 20:24.560
may we fall into eternal suffering!

20:24.640 --> 20:27.280
If this vow is broken,
may we fall into eternal suffering!

20:29.320 --> 20:30.680
The Jade Sky Palace also swears this.

20:30.760 --> 20:32.960
From now on, humans and spirits
shall be treated as equals.

20:33.040 --> 20:33.880
There will be no more spirit slaves.

20:36.360 --> 20:38.480
The Mirage Palace is willing
to follow Mr. Xie's decree.

20:38.560 --> 20:40.560
Starting today,
the Spirit Management Bureau is abolished.

20:40.640 --> 20:42.240
There will be no oppression
against the Spirit Clan.

20:49.000 --> 20:50.920
I've sent disciples to the Dark Abyss.

20:51.560 --> 20:53.000
If Miss Gao and Mr. Fu return,

20:53.640 --> 20:54.520
they will receive immediate support.

21:02.920 --> 21:03.960
There is one more matter.

21:06.200 --> 21:07.440
I hope you will all agree.

21:10.160 --> 21:11.440
Previously, due to my father's death

21:11.520 --> 21:13.000
and the crisis in the Alliance,

21:14.080 --> 21:15.920
I took on the position of Alliance Leader
in a time of crisis.

21:17.200 --> 21:19.960
However, this role is not one I desire.

21:20.680 --> 21:22.040
Now that the Immortals Array is rebuilt,

21:22.120 --> 21:24.440
the Dark Clan sealed,
and humans and spirits at peace,

21:25.960 --> 21:27.560
I believe the position

21:28.880 --> 21:30.320
should be entrusted
to someone more suitable.

21:34.760 --> 21:36.520
Saint Xuanxin is highly skilled,

21:37.040 --> 21:37.880
pure-hearted, and virtuous.

21:37.960 --> 21:41.200
In the battle against the Dark Clan,
he made great contributions.

21:41.280 --> 21:42.200
He is admired by all.

21:42.280 --> 21:43.920
I believe Saint Xuanxin

21:44.640 --> 21:47.400
can lead the Immortal Alliance
to regain peace.

21:53.120 --> 21:54.600
That day in the Hall of Integrity,

21:54.680 --> 21:55.920
all sect leaders
requested an Alliance Leader.

21:56.000 --> 21:58.440
Mr. Xie said
he was only a temporary substitute.

21:59.160 --> 22:00.360
If we insist now,

22:00.440 --> 22:02.120
it would be repaying his favor
with disrespect.

22:02.200 --> 22:03.560
Moreover,

22:04.080 --> 22:06.560
Saint Xuanxin
is undoubtedly qualified for this role

22:07.400 --> 22:08.560
and earns everyone's trust.

22:10.720 --> 22:12.000
Saint Xuanxin,

22:14.200 --> 22:15.440
are you willing
to take on this responsibility?

22:23.440 --> 22:26.360
I, Xuanxin, will not fail your trust.

22:37.280 --> 22:38.320
I hope everyone will unite,

22:38.400 --> 22:40.040
protect all beings,

22:40.120 --> 22:41.400
and avoid repeating past mistakes.

22:43.000 --> 22:44.120
-Understood!
-Understood!

22:46.800 --> 22:48.320
Now that the crisis is over,

22:48.400 --> 22:49.880
I trust Xuanxin

22:49.960 --> 22:51.840
will lead the Immortal Alliance
to flourish again.

22:55.240 --> 22:56.680
As for the Snow City,

22:58.080 --> 22:59.400
I hope to entrust it to the two of you.

23:00.160 --> 23:01.160
There's one thing

23:01.680 --> 23:03.360
I can no longer hide from you.

23:05.040 --> 23:06.400
Mu Xuanling is the Chaos Pearl.

23:07.240 --> 23:08.920
Mu Xuanling is the Chaos Pearl?

23:11.880 --> 23:13.600
Previously,
to prevent others from targeting her,

23:14.120 --> 23:16.200
I deliberately hid her identity.

23:16.840 --> 23:18.200
But what I owe her,

23:19.040 --> 23:20.840
what humanity owes her, is too great.

23:20.920 --> 23:23.440
Ten thousand years ago, the Chaos Pearl
sacrificed herself to mend the heavens,

23:23.520 --> 23:25.000
bearing the weight of the world's fate.

23:26.040 --> 23:27.280
Six thousand years ago,

23:27.360 --> 23:29.880
the Immortal Alliance used the Chaos Pearl
to create the Immortals Array,

23:29.960 --> 23:31.600
once again exhausting her spiritual power.

23:32.120 --> 23:33.120
Throughout this journey,

23:33.200 --> 23:35.680
she aided the Immortal Alliance,
only to be doubted repeatedly

23:36.200 --> 23:37.320
and sacrificed.

23:38.680 --> 23:40.720
Now, she has even died to save me.

23:41.360 --> 23:43.080
I owe her my life,

23:44.400 --> 23:46.440
and humanity and the Alliance
owe her greatly.

23:47.560 --> 23:48.800
No matter what,

23:50.360 --> 23:51.920
I will repay her.

23:53.360 --> 23:54.440
Besides,

23:56.880 --> 23:58.640
she is the one I love.

24:00.440 --> 24:01.600
I must bring her back.

24:03.560 --> 24:04.400
Alright.

24:05.200 --> 24:06.040
I see now.

24:07.520 --> 24:08.360
Xuechen,

24:08.880 --> 24:11.920
protecting the Snow City
is our responsibility.

24:12.440 --> 24:13.560
Go without worry.

25:06.880 --> 25:08.200
So, this is the Lotus of Life.

25:08.280 --> 25:10.440
It truly exists in this world.

25:16.760 --> 25:17.840
Who are you?

25:17.920 --> 25:20.000
Are you here
to wait for the Lotus of Life as well?

25:20.720 --> 25:21.800
I came to save someone.

25:21.880 --> 25:24.360
Save someone? Who?

25:25.720 --> 25:26.600
The one I love.

25:29.120 --> 25:30.840
Clinging to love

25:30.920 --> 25:32.600
will lead to nothing good.

25:33.560 --> 25:34.800
As for the Lotus of Life…

25:36.360 --> 25:37.560
I will not yield it.

25:37.640 --> 25:39.400
The Lotus is about to bloom.

25:40.640 --> 25:42.720
But no one knows when that day will come.

25:43.680 --> 25:44.520
Why don't we wait together?

25:45.480 --> 25:47.080
If I wait, it won't be with you.

25:48.200 --> 25:49.920
There's a story about Lord Qian Guang.

25:50.440 --> 25:53.080
I wonder, Madam,
would you care to hear it?

27:35.280 --> 27:36.120
Hey.

27:36.720 --> 27:38.040
The one you speak of

27:38.120 --> 27:39.680
is your beloved?

27:42.280 --> 27:44.400
She's the one I vowed to protect forever.

27:48.000 --> 27:48.880
That's nice.

28:12.600 --> 28:14.080
Lord Qian Guang
has been searching for you.

28:27.520 --> 28:28.920
Qian Guang's beloved one

28:29.920 --> 28:30.920
has always been you.

28:57.240 --> 28:58.240
Feng Xiang,

29:00.400 --> 29:01.800
I was wrong back then.

29:02.800 --> 29:04.920
If I had told you at the right time

29:05.960 --> 29:07.600
that the one I love is you,

29:09.320 --> 29:12.160
you wouldn't have suffered
6,000 years of torment.

29:13.800 --> 29:16.000
I'd rather
I'd never seen High Cyclic Divinity

29:17.320 --> 29:19.240
and spent just a thousand years with you.

29:19.760 --> 29:21.760
But if I hadn't seen him,

29:22.560 --> 29:25.320
I couldn't bear
leaving you alone in this world

29:26.720 --> 29:29.120
to endure endless rebirth.

29:31.120 --> 29:32.680
So close,

29:33.680 --> 29:35.280
yet so far.

29:35.360 --> 29:36.960
-Qian Guang…
-This path

29:38.320 --> 29:39.640
was doomed to be wrong.

29:41.080 --> 29:43.320
-Feng Xiang…
-Qian Guang…

29:43.400 --> 29:45.720
If only I could break
this cycle of rebirth for you,

29:49.680 --> 29:51.200
how wonderful that would be.

30:02.360 --> 30:03.360
Qian Guang…

31:00.360 --> 31:01.720
You know very well

31:02.720 --> 31:04.200
the price of defying the natural order.

31:08.920 --> 31:11.320
Do you know what price you'll pay

31:11.960 --> 31:13.920
when you see High Cyclic Divinity?

31:16.200 --> 31:18.280
As long as I'm the one to bear the price,

31:19.880 --> 31:21.120
it will be fine.

31:21.640 --> 31:23.520
Just to see him,

31:25.040 --> 31:28.640
one must endure 38,000 celestial winds.

31:29.640 --> 31:31.680
They will consume your spirit,

31:32.680 --> 31:34.400
like death by thousands of cuts.

31:34.920 --> 31:36.720
If I were the one to die,

31:38.360 --> 31:40.880
she would have no hesitation
in taking the Lotus of Life.

31:43.160 --> 31:44.920
All I hope for in the divine realm

31:46.720 --> 31:48.920
is to find a way to bring her back.

31:49.000 --> 31:50.640
When faced with love,

31:52.280 --> 31:53.760
we are all the same.

31:56.120 --> 31:57.080
Go.

31:57.880 --> 32:01.040
Do what you wish to do,
save the one you wish to save…

32:04.480 --> 32:06.320
while there's still time.

33:05.280 --> 33:08.680
THE DIVINE EXECUTION PLATFORM

33:31.120 --> 33:32.080
Xuanling,

33:33.160 --> 33:34.960
I still have many promises

33:35.040 --> 33:36.480
to you left undone.

33:37.080 --> 33:39.160
Our pact has only just begun.

33:40.480 --> 33:42.360
I won't let you leave me.

34:35.560 --> 34:37.000
If you had given it your all,

34:37.080 --> 34:39.400
you could have saved her, couldn't you?

34:40.040 --> 34:41.840
But you didn't.

34:41.920 --> 34:44.360
Xie Xuechen, do you regret it?

34:55.880 --> 34:57.600
But as a disciple of the Snow City,

34:57.680 --> 34:59.120
it is my duty to protect the Lord.

34:59.200 --> 35:00.040
Why doubt me?

35:01.920 --> 35:03.880
Then why do you still charge forward?

35:03.960 --> 35:05.600
Wouldn't it be easier to leave them
to their fate?

35:09.040 --> 35:10.480
Xie Xuechen.

35:11.480 --> 35:13.240
You just can't bear to let me die.

35:25.880 --> 35:28.160
I love you.

36:27.800 --> 36:28.800
Xuanling…

36:45.240 --> 36:46.240
Xuanling…

36:51.320 --> 36:52.280
Wait for me.

37:40.400 --> 37:41.800
Who are you?

37:44.440 --> 37:46.240
I'm Xie Xuechen, a human sword cultivator,

37:47.840 --> 37:49.160
seeking an audience
with Your Supreme Deity.

38:15.240 --> 38:18.680
It has been ages since anyone set foot
on this Divine Execution Platform.

38:25.320 --> 38:26.960
CYCLES OF REBIRTH

38:27.040 --> 38:28.600
Those 38,000 steps

38:29.920 --> 38:31.400
are the Divine Execution Platform?

38:31.480 --> 38:32.360
Indeed.

38:33.120 --> 38:35.840
Thirty-eight thousand blades
slash at the primordial spirit.

38:35.920 --> 38:37.520
Only those with resilient spirits

38:37.600 --> 38:38.800
and unwavering resolve

38:38.880 --> 38:40.720
can survive the Divine Execution Platform.

38:40.800 --> 38:42.200
For you to come this far,

38:42.720 --> 38:44.960
you must have met Feng Xiang
and Qian Guang.

38:45.040 --> 38:46.040
Yes.

38:46.120 --> 38:48.880
Then, do you know that making a wish to me

38:49.400 --> 38:51.640
comes at a small price?

38:51.720 --> 38:52.720
I understand.

38:53.240 --> 38:54.720
But I want to confirm one thing.

38:55.320 --> 38:56.480
Does this price

38:57.000 --> 38:59.920
fall solely on me
without involving others?

39:00.000 --> 39:02.800
The fewer people your wish involves,

39:02.880 --> 39:05.280
the fewer people will be affected.

39:05.960 --> 39:07.160
I recall

39:07.760 --> 39:10.560
someone once wished
for something that affected all beings,

39:11.200 --> 39:12.840
and the price was great.

39:14.160 --> 39:15.440
I only wish to save one person.

39:16.720 --> 39:19.160
Among the Divine Clan, powers differ.

39:19.240 --> 39:21.280
To bring someone back to life,

39:21.880 --> 39:23.560
only two deities can achieve.

39:23.640 --> 39:25.560
One is High Fate Divinity
with the Book of Fate,

39:25.640 --> 39:27.240
and the other is Primal Celestial Maiden.

39:27.320 --> 39:29.480
Primal Celestial Maiden
was reborn as Su Ningxi,

39:30.040 --> 39:32.000
so it's unlikely we can start from her.

39:32.560 --> 39:35.000
May I ask, where is High Fate Divinity?

39:35.080 --> 39:37.160
If you intend to seek his help…

39:37.840 --> 39:38.680
Well,

39:39.280 --> 39:40.840
I have never met him,

39:41.360 --> 39:44.560
but I slightly recall
that he is cold and unfeeling,

39:44.640 --> 39:46.640
unlike me, who is more approachable.

39:47.160 --> 39:48.880
Legends say
the Divine Clan abandoned humanity,

39:48.960 --> 39:50.480
cutting off all contact.

39:50.560 --> 39:52.800
So, why did you leave
the Lotus of Life to draw humans?

39:53.400 --> 39:55.800
And also, what is this place?

39:56.320 --> 39:57.680
It's understandable that you have doubts.

39:58.880 --> 40:00.560
Even I am puzzled

40:01.760 --> 40:04.480
why I am the only one left in this realm.

40:05.520 --> 40:06.680
You don't know either?

40:08.600 --> 40:09.720
Ten thousand years ago,

40:10.680 --> 40:12.760
someone asked me to wait here
for a person.

40:13.600 --> 40:15.360
But the one never told me

40:15.440 --> 40:17.840
what this person would look like,

40:17.920 --> 40:20.080
male or female, old or young.

40:21.800 --> 40:23.520
I can sense the Divine Clan
hasn't disappeared,

40:25.040 --> 40:26.360
but where have they gone?

40:27.280 --> 40:30.680
It seems something important
happened long ago, yet I've forgotten it.

40:31.960 --> 40:33.240
But forgotten is forgotten.

40:33.760 --> 40:36.000
There must be a power greater than mine

40:36.520 --> 40:37.480
that made me forget.

40:38.600 --> 40:39.720
The Book of Fate…

40:41.080 --> 40:41.920
Yes.

40:42.440 --> 40:43.840
Perhaps it was the Book of Fate.

40:44.440 --> 40:45.440
Someone used it

40:45.520 --> 40:46.960
to manipulate the destiny
of the Divine Clan.

40:47.040 --> 40:47.880
Do you know

40:48.480 --> 40:49.760
the Book of Fate

40:49.840 --> 40:51.600
is an artifact of lies?

40:51.680 --> 40:53.000
Its words become law,

40:53.080 --> 40:54.920
and all lies it tells become truth.

40:55.000 --> 40:58.320
Its power surpasses mine, but equally,

40:58.920 --> 41:01.160
it demands a great price.

41:03.080 --> 41:06.960
No reward comes without a cost.

41:07.560 --> 41:10.480
If I only wish to save one person,
can you help me?

41:10.560 --> 41:12.920
I can send you back to the past

41:13.560 --> 41:16.280
to alter that person's fate
before her death.

41:16.360 --> 41:18.040
Think carefully

41:18.120 --> 41:20.680
about when and where you wish to return.

41:21.400 --> 41:23.920
I will use the Cycles of Rebirth
to send you back.

41:24.000 --> 41:25.600
If the Immortals Array wasn't destroyed,

41:26.200 --> 41:27.440
there'd be no need to rebuild it.

41:27.520 --> 41:29.320
In the end, she wouldn't have died.

41:30.360 --> 41:32.200
I wish to return to the moment
before the Immortals Array was broken

41:32.280 --> 41:33.520
to stop He Xianwo.
